@startuml Admin View Products - Sequence Diagram

actor Admin
participant "ProductController" as ProductCtrl
participant "Product" as Product
participant "View" as View

== View Products ==
Admin -> ProductCtrl: index()
ProductCtrl -> Product: with(category)->get()
Product --> ProductCtrl: products
ProductCtrl -> View: show admin.products.index(products)
View --> Admin: display products list

@enduml
